A pending argument holds what its consumer reads (ownership-v2.md §2.8, A pending argument; R-4.8.5; #1018): `changed`
reads none of `model.todos`, so the map's edit of the todos is accepted. v2 also accepts it for `both`, which reads the
list's own array (`List.length`) and no element, where v1 refuses it; `firstDone` reads an element, and both refuse.
